---
description: Prepare one modelProduction evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: TheatreScene[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Reconcile cast availability, venue constraints, props, accessibility arrangements, and participant boundaries. Identify scenes requiring qualified stage control or specific resources, and keep physical-safety instructions outside improvisational model authority. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
